            "detailed_description": "Krinkle Krusher is an action castle defense game where you cast elemental spells to defend your kingdom from twisted and hungry creatures called Krinkles.  <br><br>After several generations of peace, they happen to come back exactly when the Ancient Tree bears its first fruits in centuries, and of course a cake was made from it. <br><br><strong>SPELLCASTING STRATEGIC ACTION!  </strong><br>Freeze, burn, and zap them all! Cast spells to defend your castle! Use the power of fire wall, ice crown, mud, energy mine, thunder and tornado! <br>Upgrade and combine your spells to face the Krinkle horde and their bosses!  <br><br><strong>HIGHLIGHTS  </strong><br>- Face more than 12 Krinkle types and 3 different bosses, each one with unique abilities and weaknesses!  <br>- Learn 6 powerful spells as you progress and upgrade them to full devastating power!  <br>- Battle in different environments that will change your strategy! <br><br>© Ilusis Interactive Graphics 2014 All Rights Reserved. Krinkle Krusher and its content is copyright of Ilusis Interactive Graphics.",
